flowchart TB
  Operator[Business owner: facts, audience, rules]
  Git[Git repository: agents, profile, workflows, Terraform]
  CI[GitHub Actions: test, apply, build, verify, install workflows]
  HCP[(HCP Terraform state and locks)]
  Operator --> Git --> CI
  CI --> HCP
  subgraph Railway[Railway environment: production or QA]
    N8N[n8n: scheduler and execution journal]
    NVol[(n8n volume: database, credentials, config)]
    API[CrewAI FastAPI: authenticated operations]
    Worker[Single durable generation worker]
    Crew[PO → BA → Research → Creative → Writer → Engineering → Editor → Tester → Delivery]
    Gate[Evidence and business-rule checks; approval hash]
    Publish[Deterministic Facebook publisher; quota and atomic claim]
    Volume[(CrewAI volume: runs, tasks, articles, publications, events)]
    Articles[Public approved article pages]
    PG[(Existing Postgres: reserved for future shared storage)]
    N8N --- NVol
    N8N -->|08:05 Central daily reservation| API
    API --> Worker --> Crew --> Gate
    Worker --- Volume
    Gate --> Volume
    N8N -->|bounded generation waits, then release-time wait| Publish
    Publish --- Volume
    Articles --- Volume
    API --- Volume
  end
  CI -->|Terraform infrastructure; Railway upload| Railway
  CI -->|n8n public API: upsert and activate| N8N
  Sources[Approved HTTPS sources] -->|bounded fetch| Worker
  LLM[Configured model provider] <--> Crew
  Publish -->|Page feed: message and article link| FB[Bun2too Facebook Page]
  FB -->|reads public article| Articles
  N8N -->|daily 07:45 Central| Metrics[Read Facebook engagement]
  FB --> Metrics --> Volume
  Volume -->|bounded measured outcomes; history as exclusions| Crew
  DD[Datadog: logs and LLM Observability]
  Volume -->|durable operational log export| DD
  Crew -->|agentless LLM spans| DD
  N8N -->|completion and error events via API| Volume
  CI -->|deployment outcome| DD
